cklace'),(206,'The new billing information has been used.'),(207,'%s sent a divorce request'),(208,'%s sent a couple request'),(209,'There are %u users in the current zone.'),(210,'You cannot enter the PK zone because the number of users exceeds the limit.'),(211,'This is the space of primary Slayers. Slayers who are not newly registered are not allowed to enter.'),(212,'Load Quest information.'),(213,'The paid usage time has expired.'),(214,'Dare to break in without permission, and immediately disappear for me!'),(215,'I don\'t want to talk to humans. Please go away.'),(216,'I\'m more sympathetic to vampires than you guys. damn things...'),(217,'Soldiers can do whatever they want? Don\'t stir up trouble.'),(218,'Loads GoodsListInfo.'),(219,'Half a vampire... humble fellows'),(220,'Your ancestors were also Slayer, right?'),(221,'Never forget that nature is always a grateful friend.'),(222,'Isn\'t it time to break free from the instinct of greed?'),(223,'Family billing has ended'),(224,'This is a skill you have already learned.'),(225,'The lottery ticket (%d) was issued. Please go to the website to confirm'),(226,'No more lottery tickets, please go to the website to confirm'),(227,'flagpole'),(228,'It is not a level that can enter and exit (access restriction: the sum of the ability value is less than 150)'),(229,'It\'s not an accessible level (level limit: 30 or less)'),(230,'Ousters'),(231,'Now the war starts on Server 1, please log in from the new one.'),(232,'Your current level is higher than the entry limit level. In this case, you cannot enter.'),(233,'You are currently a free user. Free users cannot move unless they are at war.'),(234,'Sweeper (%s) was picked up by %s (%s) from the sweeper storage at %s.'),(235,'Sweeper (%s) has been acquired by %s (%s).'),(236,'Sweeper (%s) was dropped by %s (%s).'),(237,'Sweeper (%s) is plugged in by %s (%s).'),(238,'middle'),(239,'Caligo Dungeon %d floor has been opened for free from %d hours to %d hours.'),(240,'The free usage time of Caligo Dungeon has ended.'),(241,'Players who have not paid after one minute will be sent to %s. Thank you'),(242,'Cannot apply for war yet.'),(243,'Only Slayers who are performing the quest can enter.'),(244,'Only vampires who are performing the quest can enter.'),(245,'Only Ousters who are performing the quest can enter.'),(246,'Ore'),(247,'Your partner\'s name is %s'),(248,'You are not couple'),(249,'Free'),(250,'Lei'),(251,'Geld'),(252,'Zard'),(253,'Cannot enter.'),(254,'Slayer Commonality'),(255,'Vampire Commonality'),(256,'Ouster Commonality'),(257,'Castle without a Master'),(258,'Team'),(259,'Guild'),(260,'Castle'),(261,'Regen Zone Tower'),(262,'Hello, you are now currently a premium user. The premium usage date is %d year %d month %d day, and today is %d year %d month %d day.'),(263,'Hello, you are now currently a regular user, and the remaining points are %d points.'),(264,'Hello, your subscription period has ended. Now your account has been converted to a normal account, and the remaining points are now %d points.'),(265,'Hello, you have converted from a Regular user to a Premium user.'),(266,'Hello, your remaining points are %d points.'),(267,'underground waterway'),(268,'Eslenia NW'),(269,'Eslenia NE'),(270,'Eslenia SW'),(271,'Eslenia Dungeon'),(272,'Drobeta SW'),(273,'Drobeta SE'),(274,'Lake Timor SW'),(275,'Lake Timor SE'),(276,'Raohm Dungeon 2F'),(277,'Bathory Dungeon 2F'),(278,'Limbo SE'),(279,'Limbo NE'),(280,'Limbo NW'),(281,'Lake Timor NE'),(282,'Mt. Rodin SW'),(283,'Mt. Rodin SE'),(284,'Eisen Dungeon 1F'),(285,'Eisen Dungeon 2F'),(286,'Holy Adam E'),(287,'Hilanom Dungeon 1F'),(288,'Hilanom Dungeon 2F'),(289,'Castalo NE'),(290,'Ghorgova Tunnel'),(291,'Drobeta NE'),(292,'Drobeta NW'),(293,'Mt. Rodin NE'),(294,'Mt. Rodin NW'),(295,'Rasen Dungeon 2F'),(296,'Raohm Dungeon 2F'),(297,'Eslenia SW'),(298,'Limbo Castle NE'),(299,'Castalo NE'),(300,'Eslenia NW'),(301,'Eslenia Dungeon'),(302,'Drobeta SE'),(303,'Lake Timor SE'),(304,'Raohm Dungeon 2F'),(305,'Limbo SE'),(306,'Limbo NW'),(307,'Drobeta SW'),(308,'Eisen Dungeon 1F'),(309,'Eisen Dungeon 2F'),(310,'Castalo NE'),(311,'Drobeta NW'),(312,'Mt. Rodin SW'),(313,'Lake Timor SE'),(314,'Raohm Dungeon 1F'),(315,'Yellow Zimott'),(316,'Green Zimott'),(317,'Blue Zimott'),(318,'Red Zimott'),(319,'Black Zimott'),(320,'Yellow zircon'),(321,'Green zircon'),(322,'Blue zircon'),(323,'Red zircon'),(324,'Black zircon'),(325,'Chief Kid, Chief Alkan'),(326,'Chief Estroider, Chief Shadow Wing, Chief Golemmer'),(327,'Chief Hell Wizard, Chief Dark Creamer, Chief Chaos Guardian'),(328,'Chief Lord Chaos, Chief Chaos Greed, Chief Dark Haze'),(329,'Chief Mum Rimmon, Chief Dunwolf Ark, Chief Dark Berith, Chief Rich Gel'),(330,'This feature is not yet supported.'),(331,'No wonder it\'s so noisy outside... Did you come here through those terrible traps?'),(332,'Please don\'t get me wrong. Although this is my place to stay, I don\'t know the origin of those traps.'),(333,'These traps have been bothering me... I really don\'t know whose masterpiece is...'),(334,'No, it seems that something is about to appear. Did you do it? Are you trying to harm me?'),(335,'Didn\'t you do it? Anyway, you are all powerful warriors.'),(336,'You remind me of a little girl named Jeanne d\'Arc.'),(337,'Her power is unmatched. When she came to me to save the country, I was in awe of her.'),(338,'I came here at a young age to save the country.'),(339,'Why are you looking for me? You also know that it is very dangerous here.'),(340,'I have a headache now and I can\'t help you for the time being...'),(341,'Oh~! It\'s really rude to drive away the guests who came to ask for help.'),(342,'Don\'t blame me, people will occasionally suffer from this disease when they are old. There will be a good show in a while. Hahahaha!'),(343,'Okay, very good! Let me take a good look.'),(344,'The scent from you makes me unbearable.'),(345,'Hahahaha! I was defeated by you guys...'),(346,'It\'s too dangerous here. Get out of here quickly... No, I can\'t stand it...'),(347,'Okay! This disease is really uncomfortable... Hehehe! Your scared expressions are so ridiculous. Let\'s play with you again...'),(348,'Stop...Stop attacking! This is not my intention. Alas~ I thought it was all right, but I didn\'t expect to get rid of evil nature.'),(349,'It has reached this point and it is irretrievable. Do you want to compromise with who I am now?'),(350,'The power Jeanne d\'Arc wanted...you don\'t want to know? How?'),(351,'At that time Jeanne d\'Arc rejected my request. However, I believe you will definitely not.'),(352,'At the time I traded Jeanne d\'Arc\'s blood and flesh for the power she wanted. I don\'t think this request is excessive.'),(353,'I suffered a lot of physical and mental harm, so I decided to cut off all contact with the outside world. Those traps were also deliberately set by me.'),(354,'I actually abandoned all my own glory...'),(355,'Come on, look! The life created with my power. You can also be reborn!'),(356,'Ah! What\'s going on? Isn\'t that enough... Without the blood of Slayer children, you can\'t create a perfect life.'),(357,'As long as there is Jeanne d\'Arc\'s blood... By the way, try it with your blood. Although it\'s not very pure...'),(358,'What I want to create is a perfect life. Your blood is flowing on me, and you should feel honored.'),(359,'The blood of people like you... Don\'t feel sorry for you. Leave everything to me!'),(360,'I really don\'t understand why you are full of hope in life... Anyway, it will turn into dust in the end... Hahaha!'),(361,'You ask who she is?'),(362,'Go back. I\'m for you.'),(363,'I warned you, this is a very dangerous place. I now...ah!...ahhhh!'),(364,'Hahaha... finally peeled off the shell.'),(365,'In order to give you something to remember, magic is used. However, it seems useless now.'),(366,'It\'s an eye-opener for you. This is the real best. It is really pitiful to look at you who are fighting against fantasy.'),(367,'How about it, is it okay to become a plaything? Hahahaha!'),(368,'No, don\'t... please! Let me go.'),(369,'From now on, nothing is an illusion!'),(370,'Okay, just follow me.'),(371,'Playing a dual character, or just waiting for food, these things make me feel very boring, Sheesh~'),(372,'Only the defending guild can use it.'),(373,'Joining the Alliance has been agreed'),(374,'Joining the Alliance has been rejected.'),(375,'Withdrawal from the Alliance has been agreed.'),(376,'Leaving the Alliance has been rejected.'),(377,'Forcibly withdrawn by the Alliance.'),(378,'The guild was forcibly withdrawn by the Alliance.'),(379,'The Alliance has been disbanded.'),(380,'^!O^!B[Event]^!- : For ^!G%d^!- minutes, Level Experience Points will be earned x2.'),(381,'^!O^!B[Event]^!- : For ^!G%d^!- minutes, monsters spawn twice as much.'),(382,'^!O^!B[Event]^!- : For ^!G%d^!- minutes, Rank Experience Points will be earned x2.'),(383,'^!O^!B[Event]^!- : For ^!G%d^!- minutes, Your Luck ability is doubled.'),(384,'^!O^!B[Event]^!- : For ^!G%d^!- minutes, Increased chance to drop special items from monsters.'),(385,'^!O^!B[Event]^!- : The event to gain x2 Level Experience Points has ended.'),(386,'^!O^!B[Event]^!- : The \"Double Monster\" spawn event has ended.'),(387,'^!O^!B[Event]^!- : The event to gain x2 Rank Experience event has ended.'),(388,'^!O^!B[Event]^!- : The time for \"Double Luck\" event has ended.'),(389,'^!O^!B[Event]^!- : The time to \"Drop Special item\" event has ended.'),(391,'You cannot delete a member while war registration is pending.'),(392,'The guild master cannot be changed while war registration is pending.'),(393,'Your level is too low to transfer permissions.'),(394,'Your reputation is too low to transfer permissions.'),(395,'This character cannot receive guild master authority.'),(396,'Cannot leave during war registration.'),(397,'This mark cannot be used.'),(398,'The slot is not empty.'),(399,'This is a token that is already equipped.'),(400,'Equipped with a